! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# Same clean tyrsc region (CR2 + Tyr203 sidechain, His148 in MM), now with STEOM natural
# transition orbitals so we can plot the bright-state STEOM transition density (more accurate
# than TDDFT; it is what drives the coupling J). orca_plot -> Gaussian cube -> PyMOL.
%maxcore 4000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%pointcharges "field_tyrsc.pc"
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
  DoSTEOMNatTransOrb true
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_tyrsc.xyz
